# String keyed map with string values, used with the str, beg, sub, dir,
# dom, end, reg and regm match methods. All the keys are valid regexes so
# that the file may be loaded with the "reg" and "regm" methods too. The
# same key set is repeated in map_variants-int.map and map_variants-ip.map
# with integer and address values so that the _int and _ip output types
# may be checked with every match method.
example.org            org
/images                images
mid                    middle
.png                   png
^/api/v[0-9]+$         api
^/u/([0-9]+)$          user-\1
